    {
      "id": "text_obsidian_details",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 405,
      "y": 295,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 180,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. MEMORY.md    (Global facts, env patterns, max 5k chars)\n2. USER.md      (User profile, habits, preferences, max 5k chars)\n3. STANDING.md  (Pinned rules injected every prompt, max 2k chars)\n4. failures.md  (Categorized lessons: failure, correction, insight, convention)\n5. sessions.db  (SQLite FTS5 full-text session & memory search index)\n6. skills/      (Procedural how-to guides stored as native SKILL.md)\n7. projects/    (Per-repo isolated project memory stores)",
      "baseline": 13,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. MEMORY.md    (Global facts, env patterns, max 5k chars)\n2. USER.md      (User profile, habits, preferences, max 5k chars)\n3. STANDING.md  (Pinned rules injected every prompt, max 2k chars)\n4. failures.md  (Categorized lessons: failure, correction, insight, convention)\n5. sessions.db  (SQLite FTS5 full-text session & memory search index)\n6. skills/      (Procedural how-to guides stored as native SKILL.md)\n7. projects/    (Per-repo isolated project memory stores)",
